Pink Pepper fit is a perceptual target, not chemical equivalence. Comfort is not liking; depth is not intensity; liking is not release readiness.

## Stop / HOLD Rules

Stop the affected stage and preserve all observations if:

- stock provenance, dilution, identity, safety, or formula arithmetic conflicts;
- any direct raw or working-stock aliquot is below 10 uL;
- an arm is not exactly 6,000 uL concentrate;
- the Peppermint working stock is not separately authorized/prepared/documented;
- codes become known or inferable before data lock;
- independent blocks are not actually independent;
- precipitation, separation, oxidation, color, or fill cues compromise the blind;
- irritation occurs;
- Benzyl Benzoate is detected as the causal difference;
- canonical cells are duplicated or missing and cannot be reconciled;
- blocks disagree materially without a resolvable preparation/serving cause;
- a protected-identity failure or takeover exclusion repeats.

Do not average through HOLD and do not replace a failed or missing arm after decoding.

